{
  "0": [
    {
      "text": "Rubber bands cost tarnish on silver",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.6600000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "coins within hours of contact.",
      "startSec": 1.6600000000000001,
      "endSec": 3.14
    }
  ],
  "1": [
    {
      "text": "Natural rubber contains sulfur as a vul",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.19
    },
    {
      "text": "canizing agent.",
      "startSec": 2.19,
      "endSec": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Direct contact with rubber causes fast,",
      "startSec": 3.4,
      "endSec": 5.51
    },
    {
      "text": "deep tarnish on silver, sometimes",
      "startSec": 5.51,
      "endSec": 7.21
    },
    {
      "text": "within hours.",
      "startSec": 7.21,
      "endSec": 7.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Yet most new collectors wrap their",
      "startSec": 7.96,
      "endSec": 9.32
    },
    {
      "text": "coins with rubber bands or store them",
      "startSec": 9.32,
      "endSec": 10.76
    },
    {
      "text": "in rubber line cases",
      "startSec": 10.76,
      "endSec": 11.6
    },
    {
      "text": "and wonder why their silver keeps",
      "startSec": 11.6,
      "endSec": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "turning black.",
      "startSec": 13,
      "endSec": 13.8
    }
  ],
  "2": [
    {
      "text": "Relative humidity below 50% is the",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.62
    },
    {
      "text": "target for silver storage,",
      "startSec": 2.62,
      "endSec": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "per the American New Mesmatic",
      "startSec": 4,
      "endSec": 5.54
    },
    {
      "text": "Association's guidelines.",
      "startSec": 5.54,
      "endSec": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Above 60% tarnish rates accelerate",
      "startSec": 7,
      "endSec": 9.21
    },
    {
      "text": "sharply.",
      "startSec": 9.21,
      "endSec": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "The chemical reaction that forms silver",
      "startSec": 10,
      "endSec": 11.64
    },
    {
      "text": "sulfide",
      "startSec": 11.64,
      "endSec": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "needs both hydrogen sulfide gas and",
      "startSec": 12,
      "endSec": 13.43
    },
    {
      "text": "moisture.",
      "startSec": 13.43,
      "endSec": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Eliminate the moisture and you cut the",
      "startSec": 14,
      "endSec": 16.29
    },
    {
      "text": "reaction rate dramatically.",
      "startSec": 16.29,
      "endSec": 17
    }
  ],
  "3": [
    {
      "text": "There are five storage materials that",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.88
    },
    {
      "text": "actively accelerate silver tarnish.",
      "startSec": 1.88,
      "endSec": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Rubber bands emit sulfur.",
      "startSec": 3.84,
      "endSec": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Newspaper contains sulfur compounds",
      "startSec": 5.32,
      "endSec": 7.09
    },
    {
      "text": "from ink.",
      "startSec": 7.09,
      "endSec": 7.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Standard cardboard off-gas is in humid",
      "startSec": 7.68,
      "endSec": 9.37
    },
    {
      "text": "environments.",
      "startSec": 9.37,
      "endSec": 10.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Wood releases acetic acid, PVC coin",
      "startSec": 10.2,
      "endSec": 12.23
    },
    {
      "text": "flips deposit green residue over time.",
      "startSec": 12.23,
      "endSec": 14.64
    },
    {
      "text": "All five are commonly used and none",
      "startSec": 14.64,
      "endSec": 15.85
    },
    {
      "text": "should touch your silver.",
      "startSec": 15.85,
      "endSec": 16.92
    }
  ],
  "4": [
    {
      "text": "3M anti-tarnished strips absorb sulfur",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.73
    },
    {
      "text": "dioxide and hydrogen sulfide from",
      "startSec": 2.73,
      "endSec": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "enclosed air before",
      "startSec": 4.4,
      "endSec": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "those gases reach the silver surface.",
      "startSec": 5.76,
      "endSec": 8.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Each strip lasts 6 to 12 months in a",
      "startSec": 8.16,
      "endSec": 10.06
    },
    {
      "text": "sealed container.",
      "startSec": 10.06,
      "endSec": 11.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Replace them when they discolor.",
      "startSec": 11.12,
      "endSec": 12.56
    },
    {
      "text": "A saturated strip stops working",
      "startSec": 12.56,
      "endSec": 14.01
    },
    {
      "text": "entirely.",
      "startSec": 14.01,
      "endSec": 14.48
    }
  ],
  "5": [
    {
      "text": "Find Silver at Do 9.99 purity tarnishes",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.99
    },
    {
      "text": "more slowly than Sterling at Do 9.25",
      "startSec": 2.99,
      "endSec": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "because Sterling's copper content",
      "startSec": 5,
      "endSec": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "provides additional reaction sites for",
      "startSec": 7,
      "endSec": 8.99
    },
    {
      "text": "tarnish.",
      "startSec": 8.99,
      "endSec": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "But Do 9.99 Find Silver, including",
      "startSec": 10,
      "endSec": 11.94
    },
    {
      "text": "American silver eagles and Canadian ma",
      "startSec": 11.94,
      "endSec": 13.61
    },
    {
      "text": "ples, will still tarnish without",
      "startSec": 13.61,
      "endSec": 15.38
    },
    {
      "text": "protection.",
      "startSec": 15.38,
      "endSec": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher purity gives you more time. It",
      "startSec": 16,
      "endSec": 18.15
    },
    {
      "text": "doesn't stop the reaction.",
      "startSec": 18.15,
      "endSec": 20
    }
  ],
  "6": [
    {
      "text": "VCI stands for Volatile Corrosion Inhib",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.6
    },
    {
      "text": "itor.",
      "startSec": 2.6,
      "endSec": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "These products release a vapor that",
      "startSec": 3.52,
      "endSec": 4.77
    },
    {
      "text": "deposits a protective layer on metal",
      "startSec": 4.77,
      "endSec": 6.5600000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "surfaces, blocking",
      "startSec": 6.5600000000000005,
      "endSec": 7.28
    },
    {
      "text": "tarnished reactions.",
      "startSec": 7.28,
      "endSec": 9.8
    },
    {
      "text": "According to Quartet Corporation's",
      "startSec": 9.8,
      "endSec": 11.09
    },
    {
      "text": "technical data, silver-specific VCI",
      "startSec": 11.09,
      "endSec": 12.74
    },
    {
      "text": "emitters maintain",
      "startSec": 12.74,
      "endSec": 13.64
    },
    {
      "text": "protection in enclosed spaces for 12 to",
      "startSec": 13.64,
      "endSec": 15.34
    },
    {
      "text": "24 months before replacement.",
      "startSec": 15.34,
      "endSec": 16.68
    }
  ],
  "7": [
    {
      "text": "Rubber contact produces the fastest",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.69
    },
    {
      "text": "tarnish rate of any common storage",
      "startSec": 1.69,
      "endSec": 3.2800000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "approach.",
      "startSec": 3.2800000000000002,
      "endSec": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "An airtight capsule alone cuts that",
      "startSec": 4.16,
      "endSec": 5.9399999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "rate by 90 percent.",
      "startSec": 5.9399999999999995,
      "endSec": 7.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Add an anti-tarnish strip inside and",
      "startSec": 7.28,
      "endSec": 8.74
    },
    {
      "text": "you're down to 5 percent of the worst",
      "startSec": 8.74,
      "endSec": 10.24
    },
    {
      "text": "case.",
      "startSec": 10.24,
      "endSec": 10.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a 20 to 1 difference and it",
      "startSec": 10.64,
      "endSec": 12.37
    },
    {
      "text": "costs about 1.50 per coin.",
      "startSec": 12.37,
      "endSec": 14
    }
  ],
  "8": [
    {
      "text": "A color indicating silica gel canister",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.2
    },
    {
      "text": "rated for your container's volume holds",
      "startSec": 2.2,
      "endSec": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "humidity",
      "startSec": 3.84,
      "endSec": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "below 50% for 6-12 months.",
      "startSec": 4.24,
      "endSec": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "When it turns pink, bake it at 250",
      "startSec": 6.24,
      "endSec": 8.69
    },
    {
      "text": "degrees for 2 hours to regenerate.",
      "startSec": 8.69,
      "endSec": 11.08
    },
    {
      "text": "One canister, an airtight container,",
      "startSec": 11.08,
      "endSec": 12.8
    },
    {
      "text": "and anti-tarnish paper costs under 20",
      "startSec": 12.8,
      "endSec": 14.45
    },
    {
      "text": "total.",
      "startSec": 14.45,
      "endSec": 14.96
    }
  ],
  "9": [
    {
      "text": "If you store silver in a home safe,",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.2800000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "check the humidity inside the safe",
      "startSec": 2.2800000000000002,
      "endSec": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "independently.",
      "startSec": 3.76,
      "endSec": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Many fire-rated safes trap moisture",
      "startSec": 5.2,
      "endSec": 6.64
    },
    {
      "text": "inside their insulation layer, creating",
      "startSec": 6.64,
      "endSec": 8.29
    },
    {
      "text": "higher humidity",
      "startSec": 8.29,
      "endSec": 8.88
    },
    {
      "text": "inside even when the room humidity is",
      "startSec": 8.88,
      "endSec": 10.96
    },
    {
      "text": "controlled.",
      "startSec": 10.96,
      "endSec": 11.88
    },
    {
      "text": "A small digital hygrometer placed",
      "startSec": 11.88,
      "endSec": 13.13
    },
    {
      "text": "inside confirms whether your setup is",
      "startSec": 13.13,
      "endSec": 14.5
    },
    {
      "text": "actually working.",
      "startSec": 14.5,
      "endSec": 15.36
    }
  ],
  "10": [
    {
      "text": "Follow for more Silver News.",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.74
    }
  ]
}